{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","modules":[{"name":"Neuron"}],"externalID":"s:6Neuron18MetalCommandStreamC","roleHeading":"Class","title":"MetalCommandStream","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MetalCommandStream","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MetalCommandStream","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MetalCommandStream\/commandsPerCommit"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MetalCommandStream\/commit()","doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MetalCommandStream\/synchronize()"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MetalCommandStream","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"GPU operations encode into the current command buffer and return immediately; nothing waits","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the GPU until the CPU actually needs a result. That happens in one of three ways:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CPU code touches a buffer a queued command uses. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TensorStorage.pointer"},{"type":"text","text":" checks the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GPUResidency"},{"type":"text","text":" and calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"synchronize()"},{"type":"text","text":". This is the normal path, and it is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes lazy execution safe: there is no synchronization point to forget."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Someone calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"synchronize()"},{"type":"text","text":" explicitly (e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Device.synchronize()"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current command buffer reaches "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"commandsPerCommit"},{"type":"text","text":" commands. It is committed "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"without"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"waiting, so the GPU starts on earlier layers while the CPU is still encoding later ones."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each command buffer gets a consecutive ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"generation"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":". Buffers record the generation of the last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"command that bound them, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"completedGeneration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the highest generation for which every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"command buffer up to and including it has finished. A buffer is safe for the CPU when its last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"generation is complete."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A training step therefore waits for the GPU about twice: once when the loss reads the network","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output, and once when the optimizer reads the gradients."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every entry point drains its own autorelease pool. Metal returns command buffers and encoders"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"autoreleased, and callers can’t be relied on to drain: "},{"code":"Classifier.fit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" runs a whole training"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"run inside one pool, so the encoder the optimizer update created each step accumulated for the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entire run. The stream holds its own strong references to the objects it keeps.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MetalCommandStream"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/neuron\/metalcommandstream"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A serial stream of GPU commands that is committed lazily.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Neuron/documentation/Neuron/MetalCommandStream/synchronize()":{"url":"\/documentation\/neuron\/metalcommandstream\/synchronize()","title":"synchronize()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"synchronize"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MetalCommandStream\/synchronize()","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Commits any queued work and blocks until every command buffer has finished."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Neuron/documentation/Neuron":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Neuron","abstract":[],"role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/neuron","identifier":"doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron"},"doc://Neuron/documentation/Neuron/MetalCommandStream":{"url":"\/documentation\/neuron\/metalcommandstream","title":"MetalCommandStream","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MetalCommandStream"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MetalCommandStream"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MetalCommandStream","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A serial stream of GPU commands that is committed lazily."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Neuron/documentation/Neuron/MetalCommandStream/commit()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MetalCommandStream\/commit()","title":"commit()","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/neuron\/metalcommandstream\/commit()","abstract":[{"text":"Commits the current command buffer without waiting for it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"commit"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}]},"doc://Neuron/documentation/Neuron/MetalCommandStream/commandsPerCommit":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Neuron\/documentation\/Neuron\/MetalCommandStream\/commandsPerCommit","title":"commandsPerCommit","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/neuron\/metalcommandstream\/commandspercommit","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How many commands to encode into one command buffer before committing it early."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"commandsPerCommit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"}]}}}